    "purpose": "The system's team in one compact stock Card: one small stock outline LinkButton per seat holder in one wrapping line, with a small stock Avatar initial, its name and stock Badges for its seat kinds (You, AI, Code), AI tier and step count; its one line on what it does is the link's stock Tooltip. Each links to its lane on the workflow map (?seat=<id>); the highlighted holder shows the stock secondary LinkButton.",
